NOTE ON CONTENT

This repository stores bibliographic metadata (titles, author lists, venues,
years, DOIs and arXiv identifiers) and short summaries written by the
maintainers. It does NOT redistribute the papers themselves or any copyrighted
full text. The `assets/` directory contains notes and machine-generated
annotations that are also covered by this license. Third-party paper content
remains under the copyright of its respective publishers and authors.
